{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、コメント有難うございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人ひとりの言葉が、すごく深くて\n読みながら、色々考えました。\n胸がぎゅーってなって、\nマクラ抱きしめながらひとつひとつ\n大切に読みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読み終わったらこんな時間になっちゃった（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな意見、すべて大切に受け止めようと思います。\n改めて、みなさんの暖かさや優しさを\n感じて、頑張らなきゃ！って\n力が湧いてきました！(｀・ω・´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにも、夢を一緒に応援し\n支えてくれる人が、居てくれている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の夢は私だけの夢ではなくなった。\n応援してくださるみなさんとの、\n夢。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んんんてーいえいやあがんばるっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして本日は、トムクルーズさん主演の映画\n「アウトロー」のジャパンプレミアに\n参加させて頂きました(*^_^*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スパイダーマン以来2回目の、\nレッドカーペットを歩かせて頂き、\nやはりすごく緊張しましたあ＞_＜\n貴重な経験を有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画のほうは、とにかくアクションがすごかったです！\n迫力があって臨場感いっぱいで＞_＜\nでも、ＣＧを一切使っていないというから驚きです！\nくるまのシーンがとくにっ！！\nそれから、難しい事件を解いていくのが\nなるほど！って感じで、\n実に見事な展開で面白かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、正直すごくこわかったです...( ^ω^  ; )\nかなり痛そうなシーンも多くて、\n例え、フィクションであっても\n私はすごく胸が痛かったです（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに公開は２．１からです＞_＜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左から、さゆりん、まいやん、まいまい、わたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生のみんなは、\nもお学校、始まったかなぁ～？(*^_^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒さに負けず、\nお互いがんばろおねっ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も、みなさんにとって\n素敵な一日になりますよおにっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさゆにゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/10/5823914/0012.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}